        "q": "Draw an ANN using the original artificial neurons (like the ones in Figure 9-3) that computes A \u2295 B (where \u2295 represents the XOR operation). Hint: A \u2295 B = (A \u2227 \u00ac B) \u2228 (\u00ac A \u2227 B).",
