        "q": "What is the problem that Glorot initialization and He initialization aim to fix?",
        "a": "Glorot initialization and He initialization were designed to make the output standard deviation as close as possible to the input standard deviation, at least at the beginning of training. This reduces the vanishing/exploding gradients problem."
